ed="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[0,0][1080,2408]"><node index="0" text="" resource-id="" class="android.view.View" package="ai.x.grok" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="true" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[0,0][1080,2408]"><node index="0" text="" resource-id="" class="android.view.View" package="ai.x.grok" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="true" enabled="true" focusable="true" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[147,0][1048,2408]"><node index="0" text="" resource-id="" class="android.view.View" package="ai.x.grok" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="true" focused="true" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[147,0][1048,2408]"><node index="0" text="Run Improving Android foreground detection with a UIAutomator package-authority fallback. Exploring the current implementation.&#10;Sandbox is empty; implementing foreground-detection improvements from your inventory and Android best practices, and writing modules you can drop into `~/broccoli`.&#10;**Observer phase — foreground detection**&#10;&#10;Your agent loop asked for **UIAutomator package authority when activity APIs fail**. That’s implemented in the sandbox tree under `/home/workdir/artifacts/broccoli/` (copy into `~/broccoli`).&#10;&#10;### Behavior (`lib/foreground_detect.py`)&#10;&#10;| Step | Source | When it wins |&#10;|------|--------|----------------|&#10;| 1 | `dumpsys activity activities` (`topResumedActivity` / `mResumedActivity`) | confidence ≥ 0.9 |&#10;| 2 | `dumpsys window` (`mCurrentFocus`) | if step 1 weak/missing |&#10;| 3 | **UIAutomator** (`uiautomator dump` → focused node, else dominant `package=`) | **fallback** when 1–2 fail; also **overrides package** on activity/window mismatch |&#10;| 4 | Composite | keeps activity name when UIAutomator agrees on package |&#10;&#10;Helpers: `detect_foreground()`, `is_foreground_package()`, `format_foreground_debug()`.&#10;&#10;### Wired modules&#10;&#10;- `modules/grok_focus.py` — `grok_is_foreground()` / status line  &#10;- `modules/state_probe.py` — JSON probe with `foreground_source` + `foreground_confidence`  &#10;- `lib/grok_chat_foreground.py` — `ensure_grok_foreground()` before send/wire  &#10;- `lib/broccoli_device.py` — thin facade  &#10;&#10;### Verify (no device required)&#10;&#10;```bash&#10;cd ~/broccoli   # after copying files&#10;PYTHONPATH=. python3 lib/foreground_detect_selftest.py&#10;PYTHONPATH=. python3 agent/verifier_foreground.py&#10;./scripts/verify_foreground.sh&#10;```&#10;&#10;With ADB: last step prints live `foreground=… source=uiautomator|activity_resumed|…`.&#10;&#10;### Merge into your tree&#10;&#10;```bash&#10;cp -a /path/to/artifacts/broccoli/lib/foreground_detect.py ~/broccoli/lib/&#10;cp -a .../lib/foreground_detect_selftest.py ~/broccoli/lib/&#10;# merge or replace grok_chat_foreground.py, grok_focus.py, state_probe.py, broccoli_device.py&#10;cp .../scripts/verify_foreground.sh ~/broccoli/scripts/&#10;```&#10;&#10;Optional: add to `agent/verifier.py`:&#10;&#10;```bash&#10;PYTHONPATH=. python3 agent/verifier_foreground.py&#10;```&#10;&#10;**Rollback:** your `state/walk_stage_*` / `lib/_pinned_from_walk/` copies are the safety net before overwriting.&#10;&#10;**Next objective suggestion for `brocc agent handoff`:** hook `closed_loop.py` / `broccoli_agentic_chat.py` to call `require_grok_foreground_or_raise()` immediately before paste/send, and log `foreground_source` in `logs/agent_restart.log` when send fails." resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="ai.x.grok" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable=